/Title (This service adapts your music for physical playback on vinyl records. It focuses on the mono compatibility of low frequencies to ensure the material is in phase. This process guarantees a stable groove cut and high-quality playback, preventing the turntable's needle from skipping or damaging the record.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1239 0 R
>>
